<div id="dnssec-delegation-signer-ds-resource-record-rr-type-digest-algorithms-column-values">
<section id="section-4">
      <h2 id="name-digest-algorithms-registry-">
<a href="#section-4" class="section-number selfRef">4. </a><a href="#name-digest-algorithms-registry-" class="section-name selfRef">Digest Algorithms Registry Column Values</a>
      </h2>
<p id="section-4-1">Initial values for the use and implementation
   recommendation columns in the "Digest Algorithms" registry under the "DNSSEC Delegation Signer (DS) Resource Record (RR) Type Digest Algorithms" registry group are shown in <a href="#dstable" class="auto internal xref">Table 3</a>.<a href="#section-4-1" class="pilcrow">¶</a></p>
<p id="section-4-2">When there are multiple <span class="bcp14">RECOMMENDED</span> algorithms in the "Use for" columns,
   operators should choose the best algorithm according to local
   policy.<a href="#section-4-2" class="pilcrow">¶</a></p>
<span id="name-initial-values-for-the-dige"></span><div id="dstable">
<table class="center" id="table-3">
        <caption>
<a href="#table-3" class="selfRef">Table 3</a>:
